      "finalText": "Only James Williams and Aisha Kim came from the Facebook campaign (cam_001), so they're the only two with follow-up tasks now. Both tasks were already due tomorrow, so the dates didn't need changing.\n\n**Kept (due 2026-11-05):**\n| Lead | Owner | Task |\n|---|---|---|\n| James Williams (ld_003) | Dana Cruz (usr_005) | tsk_032 |\n| Aisha Kim (ld_005) | Jordan Lee (usr_002) | tsk_034 |\n\n**Cancelled (not from the Facebook campaign):**\n- tsk_031: Ravi Haddad (ld_009), from Google Ads\n- tsk_033: Jack Rossi (ld_015), from a webinar\n- tsk_035: Zoe Patel (ld_011), from a referral\n\n**Still assigned:** Ravi Haddad (ld_009) and Zoe Patel (ld_011) are still assigned to Priya Shah from the first pass. I can't remove an owner here, only switch them to a different rep. Jack Rossi was already Jordan Lee's lead before, so nothing changed there.",
